        dct:description "The GIF is a 12-frame, 640x480 animation. cv_sim_similarity against the gallery photograph is 82.2 (orientation, 24-bin radial FFT, structure-tensor coherency, occupancy), using the same crop as verify_image_fitness.py. The colour table is taken from that photograph. Deducted because the saturated field is three ocelli rather than the gallery spiral, the photograph is a 100 μm stylized frame rather than a 242 nm micrograph, and no segmentation of either image is reported yet." ;
